      "cooked": "<p>Does the ongoing effect of a card effect only the hero using it, or all heroes?</p><p>Ex: Ra has a card that increases all Fire damage by one, and also changes the damage type of all heros to Fire. When this ongoing card is in play, does this essentially mean that all damage done by all other heroes is Fire+1 as long as the ongoing card is in play?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks</p>",
